Refactoring Roadmap
Priority 1: High Complexity & Technical Debt
Inventory/Products: Move components from routes to lib, extract controllers.
Service/Devices: Break down 100KB monolith into components + controller.
Priority 2: Standardization
Sales: Ensure all pages use controllers (already started).
Finance: Extract logic from 
accounting/+page.svelte
.
Priority 3: Maintenance
Settings: No immediate changes needed.
Key Takeaway
You do NOT need to over-engineer simple pages.

If a page is just "View List" + "Delete Item", a simple Service call or a lightweight single-file Controller is fine.
Full Structure (components/ + controllers/) is reserved for complex features like Products, POS, Device Management, etc.
